# Build context allowlist for the harness arena images (docker build -f harness/arena/containers/<id>/Dockerfile .).
# Only the arena's code enters an image: never run outputs, kernel homes (private signing keys),
# transcripts, dry runs or anything else in the repository.
*
!harness/arena/
harness/arena/runs/
harness/arena/dryrun/
harness/arena/test/
**/_kernel/
**/transcripts/
**/*.pem
**/.env*
